    user_response: "**CRITICAL REVISION: Redesign and Content Realignment**\n\n**1. Content Architecture & Prioritization (ECM Focus)**\n\n* **Remove:** Completely delete the \"Datacap Barcode Injector / QR Generator\" project. This is incorrect.\n* **Deprioritize:** Move the MERN/React side projects (Dynamic Invitations, Financial Tracker) to the bottom of the projects list, or minimize them to a secondary \"Additional Projects\" grid.\n* **Primary Focus:** The entire portfolio must center on my identity as an **ECM Technical Consultant & Software Engineer**.\n* **Elevate:** Put my enterprise work front and center in the Hero and Projects sections. Emphasize:\n* Multi-threaded Java ingestion services for FileNet P8.\n* Complex IBM Datacap application development.\n* IBM CMOD administration and custom archival utility development.\n* Integration engineering between FileNet, Litera FileTrail, and external CRM systems via SOAP WebServices.\n\n\n\n**2. UI/UX & Theming (Remove Blue)**\n\n* Strip out all blue color palettes.\n* Implement a sophisticated, modern minimalist dark theme. Use a monochromatic scale (deep charcoals, pure blacks, and slate grays) for backgrounds and cards.\n* Use a high-contrast, professional accent color (like a subtle gold, amber, or emerald) *only* for buttons and hover states.\n* Update the `tailwind.config.ts` to reflect this new palette.\n\n**3. Interactivity & Animations**\n\n* The current UI is too static. heavily utilize `framer-motion`.\n* Implement `staggerChildren` on the Projects and Experience grids so cards cascade in on scroll.\n* Add hover states to all cards using `<motion.div whileHover={{ scale: 1.02, y: -5 }}>` with a subtle box-shadow glow.\n* Ensure the Hero section has a distinct entrance animation (e.g., text fading up sequentially)."
    items {
      text: "**CRITICAL REVISION: Redesign and Content Realignment**\n\n**1. Content Architecture & Prioritization (ECM Focus)**\n\n* **Remove:** Completely delete the \"Datacap Barcode Injector / QR Generator\" project. This is incorrect.\n* **Deprioritize:** Move the MERN/React side projects (Dynamic Invitations, Financial Tracker) to the bottom of the projects list, or minimize them to a secondary \"Additional Projects\" grid.\n* **Primary Focus:** The entire portfolio must center on my identity as an **ECM Technical Consultant & Software Engineer**.\n* **Elevate:** Put my enterprise work front and center in the Hero and Projects sections. Emphasize:\n* Multi-threaded Java ingestion services for FileNet P8.\n* Complex IBM Datacap application development.\n* IBM CMOD administration and custom archival utility development.\n* Integration engineering between FileNet, Litera FileTrail, and external CRM systems via SOAP WebServices.\n\n\n\n**2. UI/UX & Theming (Remove Blue)**\n\n* Strip out all blue color palettes.\n* Implement a sophisticated, modern minimalist dark theme. Use a monochromatic scale (deep charcoals, pure blacks, and slate grays) for backgrounds and cards.\n* Use a high-contrast, professional accent color (like a subtle gold, amber, or emerald) *only* for buttons and hover states.\n* Update the `tailwind.config.ts` to reflect this new palette.\n\n**3. Interactivity & Animations**\n\n* The current UI is too static. heavily utilize `framer-motion`.\n* Implement `staggerChildren` on the Projects and Experience grids so cards cascade in on scroll.\n* Add hover states to all cards using `<motion.div whileHover={{ scale: 1.02, y: -5 }}>` with a subtle box-shadow glow.\n* Ensure the Hero section has a distinct entrance animation (e.g., text fading up sequentially)."
